    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to display your events on your WordPress site. No complex setup or API credentials – just enter your Bookitbee account ID, and you’re all set.</p>\n<h3>Customizable</h3>\n<p>Easily customize colors to fit your design; choose to show or hide images, dates, and locations. Automatically apply discount codes to reward your customers.</p>\n<h3>Bookitbee: Ticketing made simple</h3>\n<p>If you’re not already a Bookitbee user, you can go from zero to selling tickets in minutes!</p>\n<p>Just sign up at <a href=\"bookitbee.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://www.bookitbee.com</a>, create your event, and start accepting bookings. There are no subscriptions or setup fees, and it’s free for free events.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/bookitbee-event-listing</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugin screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>In your Bookitbee Event Dashboard, go to My account and scroll to the bottom of the page to find your account ID.</li>\n<li>In your WordPress admin, go to Settings &gt; Booktibee Event Listing and enter your account ID.</li>\n<li>Add the event listing block to your page. You can customise the colors and layout in the edit panel.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Display live event listings from your Bookitbee account.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to display your events on your WordPress site. No complex setup or API credentials – just enter your Bookitbee account ID, and you’re all set.</p>\n<h3>Customizable</h3>\n<p>Easily customize colors to fit your design; choose to show or hide images, dates, and locations. Automatically apply discount codes to reward your customers.</p>\n<h3>Bookitbee: Ticketing made simple</h3>\n<p>If you’re not already a Bookitbee user, you can go from zero to selling tickets in minutes!</p>\n<p>Just sign up at <a href=\"bookitbee.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://www.bookitbee.com</a>, create your event, and start accepting bookings. There are no subscriptions or setup fees, and it’s free for free events.</p>\n",
